  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你见过吗？诺贝尔颁奖台上，一个外国老头当着全世界的面单膝跪下，他不是在领奖，他是在给一位坐着的中国老太太举话筒，话筒，架太高线又短，老太太够不着。大会副主席没叫工作人员自己直接跪在冰凉的大理石地上，一手扶着椅背，一手稳稳的举着话筒，一直举到老太太讲，完全又全场，先是敬的掉根针都能听见。接着掌声跟打雷似的震的耳朵嗡嗡响。这一跪跪的是对科学的敬畏，更是对一个救了几百万人命的中国医生的敬意。可你知道吗？就是这位让全世界都俯首的老太太，在咱们国内整整四十年，连名字都没几个人知道她叫屠呦呦。这事儿得从上世纪六十年代说起。那时候，越南战场上最要命的不是枪子儿，是文字被咬一口，染上疟疾，先冷得浑身打颤，骨头缝里都冒寒气，转眼又烧到四十度，说胡话，抽风，昏迷几天，人就没了。因疟疾倒下的士兵比重担的多了好几倍，不光是战场，全世界一百多个国家，上亿人被疟疾折腾，每年上百万人丢了命。西方大药厂砸了几十亿，筛了几十万种化学药全失败了，人类眼看着就要拿着病，没辙了。一九六七年，国家启动了代号五二三的秘密抗虐任务，全国调集力量找新药。一九六九年，这个烫手的山芋落到了北京一个三十九岁的女研究员手里，她叫屠呦呦，当时就是中医研究院，一个普通的科研人员，没名气，没头衔，连团队都是临时凑的。说是组长其实就那么几个人，要设备、没设备，要经费，没经费，要经验，没经验更难的是，那时候她两个女儿大的才四岁，小的还不会走路。丈夫在外地工作，家里根本顾不上，他咬咬牙把大女儿送去全托，把小女儿送回宁波老家，托给外婆带一家四口分居三地。后来有人问他舍得吗？他没说什么，豪言壮语，就说国家交给的任务得完成，接下来的日子就两个字，硬熬。他带着团队把老祖宗传下来的遗书，一本一本翻本草纲目肘后背疾方千金方，前前后后收集了两千多个药方，一个一个筛筛出六百四十多种可能有效的再一个一个市，整整数百次实验全失败，不是药效微弱，就是毒性超标。团队里有人开始动摇了，说是不是方向就不对，连西医都搞不定的事儿，翻老皇帝能有什么用？他没辩解，继续翻书，继续做实验。转机出现在一本一千七百年前的古书上东晋葛洪写的肘后背及方里。有一句话，青蒿一卧，沂水二生字叫去之，尽扶之。他盯着缴曲之。这三个字看了很久，老祖宗用的是字，是炮，是脚，也就是拧之，不是煎，不是熬。是不是高温煎煮，把青蒿里最关键的有效成分给破坏了，他一下子全明白了。之前所有的实验方向全错了。第二天，他就推翻了之前的全部方案。不用水煎，改用乙醚，低温提取乙醚沸点只有三十四点六度，能最大程度保住药性。可那时候条件差，实验室连像样的通风设备都没有，乙醚又刺鼻又有毒。白色的雾气弥漫整个房间，他戴着口罩，硬扛着继续记录数据。头晕了，就坐一会儿缓过来，接着干没几天，团队里好几个人开始头晕，流鼻血，屠呦呦自己的肝脏也受了损伤。可他一步没退，一九七一年十月四号。第一百九十一号样品对疟原虫的抑制率达到了百分之百，整个实验室沸腾了，这百分之百意味着上亿。被疟疾折磨的人终于看到了活路，可高兴。没多久，新问题来了，动物实验发现这个提取物有疑似毒性反应药能治病，但给人吃到底安不安全，没人敢拍胸脯按流流程，得先做长期动物实验，再慢慢等审批。可疟季是季节病，错过这几个月就得再等一年。海南的疫病区每天都有人在发烧，在死人几百万条命，等不起。屠呦呦做了一个决定，拿自己先试，他跟领导表态自己是族长。第一个是出了事，他担着一九七二年，他和另外两名同事直接住进了北京东直门医院，亲手把还没确定安全性的青蒿提取物喝了下去，连吃了好几天，每天记录身体反应。后来有人问他，你不怕吗？这药万一有毒呢，他没说什么豪言壮语，就说没想那么多，就想赶紧把药用到病人身上。第一批药是他用自己的身体试出来的。一九七二年，青蒿素成功分离出来之后的事，全世界都知道了。世卫组织把青蒿素列为抗虐一线药物，全球疟疾死亡率应声生降了一半以上。光在非洲就有数不清的孩子，因为这味药活了下来。可讽刺的是什么？从一九七二年到二零一一年，将近四十年，国内知道屠呦呦这个名字的人却寥寥无几。因为那时候成果论文署名是集体很长一段时间，没人知道背后的核心人物是他他就那么安安静静的。在实验室里待着，一呆就是一辈子。在单位里，他一直是最不起眼的那一个申报院士，前前后后好几次每次都落选，他一句牢骚没有，还是天天泡实验室该干嘛干嘛。直到后来，一位美国专家到非洲调研发现青蒿素，让当地疟疾死亡率直降一半。特地跑到中国来寻根，可他走访了多家参演单位。家家都说成果是自己的，根本查不到谁是关键人物。最后他换了个问法，您觉得第二重要的人是谁？几家的答案出奇的一致。屠呦呦，二零一一年，八十一岁的屠呦呦拿到了美国拉斯克奖医学界分量最重的奖项之一，被称为诺奖风向标国人才。第一次大规模的听说这个名字，原来中国竟有这样一位了不起的科学家。二零一五年十月五号，八十五岁的屠呦呦是后来从电视新闻里才知道自己得了诺贝尔奖。他耳朵背之前的很多事儿都后知后觉，站上领奖台。他满头白发，穿着一身素雅的旗袍，平静的说了一句，青蒿素是中医药献给世界的礼物。那一刻，全世界都在为这位中国老太太鼓掌。可你知道吗？就算拿了诺贝尔奖，就算全世界都认他，屠呦呦到现在依然不是中国科学院的院士，一个救了几百万人命的科学家，一个拿了诺贝尔奖的科学家，为什么在自己的国家连院士都评不上他？这一辈子到底还亏欠了多少人，又被多少人亏欠关注我。下集我们接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 890,
      "text": "你见过吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1550,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "诺贝尔颁奖台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3150,
      "end_ms": 7410,
      "text": "一个外国老头当着全世界的面单膝跪下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8250,
      "end_ms": 9390,
      "text": "他不是在领奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9750,
      "end_ms": 13030,
      "text": "他是在给一位坐着的中国老太太举话筒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 14050,
      "text": "话筒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14050,
      "end_ms": 15610,
      "text": "架太高线又短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15830,
      "end_ms": 16810,
      "text": "老太太够不着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17570,
      "end_ms": 23090,
      "text": "大会副主席没叫工作人员自己直接跪在冰凉的大理石地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23510,
      "end_ms": 24830,
      "text": "一手扶着椅背，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25050,
      "end_ms": 26870,
      "text": "一手稳稳的举着话筒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27350,
      "end_ms": 28770,
      "text": "一直举到老太太讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28770,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "完全又全场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30480,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "先是敬的掉根针都能听见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33780,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "text": "接着掌声跟打雷似的震的耳朵嗡嗡响。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38400,
      "end_ms": 41660,
      "text": "这一跪跪的是对科学的敬畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42080,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "更是对一个救了几百万人命的中国医生的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47900,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49080,
      "end_ms": 52240,
      "text": "就是这位让全世界都俯首的老太太，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52660,
      "end_ms": 55360,
      "text": "在咱们国内整整四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55600,
      "end_ms": 59435,
      "text": "连名字都没几个人知道她叫屠呦呦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00022",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 63195,
      "text": "这事儿得从上世纪六十年代说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64300,
      "end_ms": 64780,
      "text": "那时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64780,
      "end_ms": 68185,
      "text": "越南战场上最要命的不是枪子儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68350,
      "end_ms": 70820,
      "text": "是文字被咬一口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71200,
      "end_ms": 72425,
      "text": "染上疟疾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00027",
      "start_ms": 72800,
      "end_ms": 74540,
      "text": "先冷得浑身打颤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74680,
      "end_ms": 76325,
      "text": "骨头缝里都冒寒气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76760,
      "end_ms": 78475,
      "text": "转眼又烧到四十度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00030",
      "start_ms": 79040,
      "end_ms": 79820,
      "text": "说胡话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80080,
      "end_ms": 80705,
      "text": "抽风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81340,
      "end_ms": 83190,
      "text": "昏迷几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00033",
      "start_ms": 83190,
      "end_ms": 84015,
      "text": "人就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84500,
      "end_ms": 88935,
      "text": "因疟疾倒下的士兵比重担的多了好几倍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00035",
      "start_ms": 89560,
      "end_ms": 90625,
      "text": "不光是战场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00036",
      "start_ms": 91090,
      "end_ms": 93150,
      "text": "全世界一百多个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00037",
      "start_ms": 93210,
      "end_ms": 95585,
      "text": "上亿人被疟疾折腾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96180,
      "end_ms": 98265,
      "text": "每年上百万人丢了命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00039",
      "start_ms": 98810,
      "end_ms": 101205,
      "text": "西方大药厂砸了几十亿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00040",
      "start_ms": 101530,
      "end_ms": 105215,
      "text": "筛了几十万种化学药全失败了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106820,
      "end_ms": 108920,
      "text": "人类眼看着就要拿着病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00042",
      "start_ms": 108920,
      "end_ms": 109545,
      "text": "没辙了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00043",
      "start_ms": 110640,
      "end_ms": 111635,
      "text": "一九六七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112600,
      "end_ms": 117280,
      "text": "国家启动了代号五二三的秘密抗虐任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117360,
      "end_ms": 119485,
      "text": "全国调集力量找新药。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00046",
      "start_ms": 119950,
      "end_ms": 121010,
      "text": "一九六九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00047",
      "start_ms": 121410,
      "end_ms": 127110,
      "text": "这个烫手的山芋落到了北京一个三十九岁的女研究员手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00048",
      "start_ms": 127470,
      "end_ms": 128490,
      "text": "她叫屠呦呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128990,
      "end_ms": 130650,
      "text": "当时就是中医研究院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00050",
      "start_ms": 130690,
      "end_ms": 132250,
      "text": "一个普通的科研人员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00051",
      "start_ms": 132670,
      "end_ms": 133390,
      "text": "没名气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00052",
      "start_ms": 133630,
      "end_ms": 134290,
      "text": "没头衔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00053",
      "start_ms": 134550,
      "end_ms": 136630,
      "text": "连团队都是临时凑的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00054",
      "start_ms": 137050,
      "end_ms": 139550,
      "text": "说是组长其实就那么几个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00055",
      "start_ms": 140110,
      "end_ms": 141470,
      "text": "要设备、没设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00056",
      "start_ms": 141690,
      "end_ms": 142430,
      "text": "要经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00057",
      "start_ms": 142470,
      "end_ms": 143150,
      "text": "没经费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143370,
      "end_ms": 144070,
      "text": "要经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00059",
      "start_ms": 144070,
      "end_ms": 147880,
      "text": "没经验更难的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00060",
      "start_ms": 148540,
      "end_ms": 151700,
      "text": "那时候她两个女儿大的才四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152020,
      "end_ms": 153440,
      "text": "小的还不会走路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00062",
      "start_ms": 153540,
      "end_ms": 154980,
      "text": "丈夫在外地工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00063",
      "start_ms": 155160,
      "end_ms": 156420,
      "text": "家里根本顾不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00064",
      "start_ms": 157080,
      "end_ms": 159960,
      "text": "他咬咬牙把大女儿送去全托，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00065",
      "start_ms": 160400,
      "end_ms": 162400,
      "text": "把小女儿送回宁波老家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00066",
      "start_ms": 162740,
      "end_ms": 166840,
      "text": "托给外婆带一家四口分居三地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00067",
      "start_ms": 167420,
      "end_ms": 169660,
      "text": "后来有人问他舍得吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00068",
      "start_ms": 169940,
      "end_ms": 170860,
      "text": "他没说什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00069",
      "start_ms": 170860,
      "end_ms": 171740,
      "text": "豪言壮语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00070",
      "start_ms": 172040,
      "end_ms": 174980,
      "text": "就说国家交给的任务得完成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00071",
      "start_ms": 175480,
      "end_ms": 177960,
      "text": "接下来的日子就两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178200,
      "end_ms": 178780,
      "text": "硬熬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00073",
      "start_ms": 180000,
      "end_ms": 183200,
      "text": "他带着团队把老祖宗传下来的遗书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00074",
      "start_ms": 183440,
      "end_ms": 190430,
      "text": "一本一本翻本草纲目肘后背疾方千金方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00075",
      "start_ms": 190630,
      "end_ms": 194530,
      "text": "前前后后收集了两千多个药方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00076",
      "start_ms": 194810,
      "end_ms": 201575,
      "text": "一个一个筛筛出六百四十多种可能有效的再一个一个市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00077",
      "start_ms": 202210,
      "end_ms": 205315,
      "text": "整整数百次实验全失败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00078",
      "start_ms": 205810,
      "end_ms": 207250,
      "text": "不是药效微弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00079",
      "start_ms": 207530,
      "end_ms": 209035,
      "text": "就是毒性超标。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00080",
      "start_ms": 209950,
      "end_ms": 211685,
      "text": "团队里有人开始动摇了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00081",
      "start_ms": 212070,
      "end_ms": 213670,
      "text": "说是不是方向就不对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00082",
      "start_ms": 213910,
      "end_ms": 215635,
      "text": "连西医都搞不定的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00083",
      "start_ms": 215870,
      "end_ms": 217705,
      "text": "翻老皇帝能有什么用？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00084",
      "start_ms": 218060,
      "end_ms": 218875,
      "text": "他没辩解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00085",
      "start_ms": 219070,
      "end_ms": 219895,
      "text": "继续翻书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00086",
      "start_ms": 220210,
      "end_ms": 221055,
      "text": "继续做实验。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00087",
      "start_ms": 221810,
      "end_ms": 230300,
      "text": "转机出现在一本一千七百年前的古书上东晋葛洪写的肘后背及方里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00088",
      "start_ms": 230300,
      "end_ms": 231105,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00089",
      "start_ms": 231650,
      "end_ms": 232745,
      "text": "青蒿一卧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00090",
      "start_ms": 233310,
      "end_ms": 236655,
      "text": "沂水二生字叫去之，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00091",
      "start_ms": 237330,
      "end_ms": 238235,
      "text": "尽扶之。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00092",
      "start_ms": 239100,
      "end_ms": 240500,
      "text": "他盯着缴曲之。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00093",
      "start_ms": 240500,
      "end_ms": 242745,
      "text": "这三个字看了很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00094",
      "start_ms": 243600,
      "end_ms": 245080,
      "text": "老祖宗用的是字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00095",
      "start_ms": 245280,
      "end_ms": 245835,
      "text": "是炮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00096",
      "start_ms": 246270,
      "end_ms": 246925,
      "text": "是脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00097",
      "start_ms": 247590,
      "end_ms": 248745,
      "text": "也就是拧之，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00098",
      "start_ms": 249290,
      "end_ms": 249970,
      "text": "不是煎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00099",
      "start_ms": 250210,
      "end_ms": 250850,
      "text": "不是熬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00100",
      "start_ms": 251270,
      "end_ms": 253114,
      "text": "是不是高温煎煮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00101",
      "start_ms": 253540,
      "end_ms": 257285,
      "text": "把青蒿里最关键的有效成分给破坏了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00102",
      "start_ms": 257630,
      "end_ms": 259265,
      "text": "他一下子全明白了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00103",
      "start_ms": 259660,
      "end_ms": 262875,
      "text": "之前所有的实验方向全错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00104",
      "start_ms": 263340,
      "end_ms": 263900,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00105",
      "start_ms": 264100,
      "end_ms": 266235,
      "text": "他就推翻了之前的全部方案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00106",
      "start_ms": 267200,
      "end_ms": 268060,
      "text": "不用水煎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00107",
      "start_ms": 268200,
      "end_ms": 269120,
      "text": "改用乙醚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00108",
      "start_ms": 269160,
      "end_ms": 273095,
      "text": "低温提取乙醚沸点只有三十四点六度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00109",
      "start_ms": 273530,
      "end_ms": 275525,
      "text": "能最大程度保住药性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00110",
      "start_ms": 276280,
      "end_ms": 277480,
      "text": "可那时候条件差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00111",
      "start_ms": 278180,
      "end_ms": 281375,
      "text": "实验室连像样的通风设备都没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00112",
      "start_ms": 281790,
      "end_ms": 284355,
      "text": "乙醚又刺鼻又有毒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00113",
      "start_ms": 284810,
      "end_ms": 287495,
      "text": "白色的雾气弥漫整个房间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00114",
      "start_ms": 288040,
      "end_ms": 289195,
      "text": "他戴着口罩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00115",
      "start_ms": 289670,
      "end_ms": 291815,
      "text": "硬扛着继续记录数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00116",
      "start_ms": 292130,
      "end_ms": 292770,
      "text": "头晕了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00117",
      "start_ms": 292810,
      "end_ms": 294590,
      "text": "就坐一会儿缓过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00118",
      "start_ms": 294630,
      "end_ms": 296635,
      "text": "接着干没几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00119",
      "start_ms": 297210,
      "end_ms": 299585,
      "text": "团队里好几个人开始头晕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00120",
      "start_ms": 300010,
      "end_ms": 300630,
      "text": "流鼻血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00121",
      "start_ms": 301390,
      "end_ms": 303910,
      "text": "屠呦呦自己的肝脏也受了损伤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00122",
      "start_ms": 304650,
      "end_ms": 306050,
      "text": "可他一步没退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00123",
      "start_ms": 306210,
      "end_ms": 307975,
      "text": "一九七一年十月四号。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00124",
      "start_ms": 308350,
      "end_ms": 313650,
      "text": "第一百九十一号样品对疟原虫的抑制率达到了百分之百，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00125",
      "start_ms": 314270,
      "end_ms": 316090,
      "text": "整个实验室沸腾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00126",
      "start_ms": 316570,
      "end_ms": 319510,
      "text": "这百分之百意味着上亿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00127",
      "start_ms": 319810,
      "end_ms": 323570,
      "text": "被疟疾折磨的人终于看到了活路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00128",
      "start_ms": 323990,
      "end_ms": 324550,
      "text": "可高兴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00129",
      "start_ms": 324550,
      "end_ms": 325130,
      "text": "没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00130",
      "start_ms": 325310,
      "end_ms": 326270,
      "text": "新问题来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00131",
      "start_ms": 326650,
      "end_ms": 332310,
      "text": "动物实验发现这个提取物有疑似毒性反应药能治病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00132",
      "start_ms": 332550,
      "end_ms": 334830,
      "text": "但给人吃到底安不安全，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00133",
      "start_ms": 335370,
      "end_ms": 338520,
      "text": "没人敢拍胸脯按流流程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00134",
      "start_ms": 339480,
      "end_ms": 341560,
      "text": "得先做长期动物实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00135",
      "start_ms": 341980,
      "end_ms": 343480,
      "text": "再慢慢等审批。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00136",
      "start_ms": 343680,
      "end_ms": 345160,
      "text": "可疟季是季节病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00137",
      "start_ms": 345520,
      "end_ms": 348680,
      "text": "错过这几个月就得再等一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00138",
      "start_ms": 349600,
      "end_ms": 353100,
      "text": "海南的疫病区每天都有人在发烧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00139",
      "start_ms": 353460,
      "end_ms": 356520,
      "text": "在死人几百万条命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00140",
      "start_ms": 357540,
      "end_ms": 358200,
      "text": "等不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00141",
      "start_ms": 359520,
      "end_ms": 361180,
      "text": "屠呦呦做了一个决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361660,
      "end_ms": 362620,
      "text": "拿自己先试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00143",
      "start_ms": 363520,
      "end_ms": 366340,
      "text": "他跟领导表态自己是族长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00144",
      "start_ms": 367200,
      "end_ms": 369390,
      "text": "第一个是出了事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00145",
      "start_ms": 369390,
      "end_ms": 372075,
      "text": "他担着一九七二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00146",
      "start_ms": 372790,
      "end_ms": 376705,
      "text": "他和另外两名同事直接住进了北京东直门医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00147",
      "start_ms": 377250,
      "end_ms": 381930,
      "text": "亲手把还没确定安全性的青蒿提取物喝了下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00148",
      "start_ms": 382290,
      "end_ms": 383550,
      "text": "连吃了好几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00149",
      "start_ms": 383770,
      "end_ms": 385625,
      "text": "每天记录身体反应。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00150",
      "start_ms": 386170,
      "end_ms": 387210,
      "text": "后来有人问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00151",
      "start_ms": 387410,
      "end_ms": 388295,
      "text": "你不怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00152",
      "start_ms": 389030,
      "end_ms": 390875,
      "text": "这药万一有毒呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00153",
      "start_ms": 391650,
      "end_ms": 393550,
      "text": "他没说什么豪言壮语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00154",
      "start_ms": 393650,
      "end_ms": 395265,
      "text": "就说没想那么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00155",
      "start_ms": 396040,
      "end_ms": 399165,
      "text": "就想赶紧把药用到病人身上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00156",
      "start_ms": 399570,
      "end_ms": 402565,
      "text": "第一批药是他用自己的身体试出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00157",
      "start_ms": 403460,
      "end_ms": 404440,
      "text": "一九七二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00158",
      "start_ms": 404640,
      "end_ms": 408320,
      "text": "青蒿素成功分离出来之后的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00159",
      "start_ms": 408560,
      "end_ms": 409955,
      "text": "全世界都知道了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00160",
      "start_ms": 410850,
      "end_ms": 415105,
      "text": "世卫组织把青蒿素列为抗虐一线药物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00161",
      "start_ms": 415650,
      "end_ms": 419625,
      "text": "全球疟疾死亡率应声生降了一半以上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00162",
      "start_ms": 420080,
      "end_ms": 422930,
      "text": "光在非洲就有数不清的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00163",
      "start_ms": 423030,
      "end_ms": 424890,
      "text": "因为这味药活了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00164",
      "start_ms": 424990,
      "end_ms": 426245,
      "text": "可讽刺的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00165",
      "start_ms": 427170,
      "end_ms": 430415,
      "text": "从一九七二年到二零一一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00166",
      "start_ms": 430850,
      "end_ms": 431885,
      "text": "将近四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00167",
      "start_ms": 432840,
      "end_ms": 436535,
      "text": "国内知道屠呦呦这个名字的人却寥寥无几。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00168",
      "start_ms": 437360,
      "end_ms": 441675,
      "text": "因为那时候成果论文署名是集体很长一段时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00169",
      "start_ms": 442020,
      "end_ms": 446570,
      "text": "没人知道背后的核心人物是他他就那么安安静静的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00170",
      "start_ms": 446570,
      "end_ms": 447865,
      "text": "在实验室里待着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00171",
      "start_ms": 448150,
      "end_ms": 449485,
      "text": "一呆就是一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00172",
      "start_ms": 450130,
      "end_ms": 451165,
      "text": "在单位里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00173",
      "start_ms": 451400,
      "end_ms": 455320,
      "text": "他一直是最不起眼的那一个申报院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00174",
      "start_ms": 455660,
      "end_ms": 458555,
      "text": "前前后后好几次每次都落选，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00175",
      "start_ms": 458960,
      "end_ms": 460240,
      "text": "他一句牢骚没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00176",
      "start_ms": 460320,
      "end_ms": 462875,
      "text": "还是天天泡实验室该干嘛干嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00177",
      "start_ms": 463510,
      "end_ms": 464330,
      "text": "直到后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00178",
      "start_ms": 464670,
      "end_ms": 468550,
      "text": "一位美国专家到非洲调研发现青蒿素，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00179",
      "start_ms": 468630,
      "end_ms": 471815,
      "text": "让当地疟疾死亡率直降一半。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00180",
      "start_ms": 472310,
      "end_ms": 474315,
      "text": "特地跑到中国来寻根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00181",
      "start_ms": 474980,
      "end_ms": 477315,
      "text": "可他走访了多家参演单位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00182",
      "start_ms": 477830,
      "end_ms": 479905,
      "text": "家家都说成果是自己的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00183",
      "start_ms": 480410,
      "end_ms": 482455,
      "text": "根本查不到谁是关键人物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00184",
      "start_ms": 483100,
      "end_ms": 484495,
      "text": "最后他换了个问法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00185",
      "start_ms": 485060,
      "end_ms": 488065,
      "text": "您觉得第二重要的人是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00186",
      "start_ms": 489130,
      "end_ms": 491575,
      "text": "几家的答案出奇的一致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00187",
      "start_ms": 493040,
      "end_ms": 493620,
      "text": "屠呦呦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00188",
      "start_ms": 493760,
      "end_ms": 494745,
      "text": "二零一一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00189",
      "start_ms": 495100,
      "end_ms": 501935,
      "text": "八十一岁的屠呦呦拿到了美国拉斯克奖医学界分量最重的奖项之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00190",
      "start_ms": 502340,
      "end_ms": 506360,
      "text": "被称为诺奖风向标国人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00191",
      "start_ms": 506380,
      "end_ms": 508635,
      "text": "第一次大规模的听说这个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00192",
      "start_ms": 509110,
      "end_ms": 513185,
      "text": "原来中国竟有这样一位了不起的科学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00193",
      "start_ms": 514180,
      "end_ms": 516145,
      "text": "二零一五年十月五号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00194",
      "start_ms": 516710,
      "end_ms": 522705,
      "text": "八十五岁的屠呦呦是后来从电视新闻里才知道自己得了诺贝尔奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00195",
      "start_ms": 523120,
      "end_ms": 526775,
      "text": "他耳朵背之前的很多事儿都后知后觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00196",
      "start_ms": 527190,
      "end_ms": 528350,
      "text": "站上领奖台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00197",
      "start_ms": 528490,
      "end_ms": 529590,
      "text": "他满头白发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00198",
      "start_ms": 529910,
      "end_ms": 532125,
      "text": "穿着一身素雅的旗袍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00199",
      "start_ms": 532590,
      "end_ms": 533955,
      "text": "平静的说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00200",
      "start_ms": 534700,
      "end_ms": 538575,
      "text": "青蒿素是中医药献给世界的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00201",
      "start_ms": 539230,
      "end_ms": 539790,
      "text": "那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00202",
      "start_ms": 540150,
      "end_ms": 543055,
      "text": "全世界都在为这位中国老太太鼓掌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00203",
      "start_ms": 543580,
      "end_ms": 544480,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00204",
      "start_ms": 544620,
      "end_ms": 546120,
      "text": "就算拿了诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00205",
      "start_ms": 546180,
      "end_ms": 548075,
      "text": "就算全世界都认他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00206",
      "start_ms": 548480,
      "end_ms": 552530,
      "text": "屠呦呦到现在依然不是中国科学院的院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00207",
      "start_ms": 553170,
      "end_ms": 555995,
      "text": "一个救了几百万人命的科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00208",
      "start_ms": 556620,
      "end_ms": 558780,
      "text": "一个拿了诺贝尔奖的科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00209",
      "start_ms": 559100,
      "end_ms": 563060,
      "text": "为什么在自己的国家连院士都评不上他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00210",
      "start_ms": 563060,
      "end_ms": 566405,
      "text": "这一辈子到底还亏欠了多少人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00211",
      "start_ms": 567230,
      "end_ms": 570535,
      "text": "又被多少人亏欠关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c93dd57c844ff532_s00212",
      "start_ms": 570930,
      "end_ms": 572300,
      "text": "下集我们接着讲。"
    }
  ],
